{"sections":[{"slug":"仿射概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"仿射概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"仿射概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形是同构于某个环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的谱</span> $\\operatorname{spec}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环化空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环化空间</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">它的特点是它的几何信息完全由整体函数环决定</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形的范畴等价于环范畴的对偶</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一例</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">通过局部环化空间</span></h3>\n<p>…</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">函子式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">函子式代数几何中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Aff}$ <span lang=\"zh\">就定义为环范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Ring}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对偶</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">仿射化</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形范畴到概形范畴的嵌入</span> $\\mathsf{Aff} \\to \\mathsf{Sch}$ <span lang=\"zh\">有左伴随</span> $X\\mapsto \\operatorname{Spec}\\Gamma(X,\\mathcal O_X)$:\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Sch}}(X,\\operatorname{Spec}A)\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ring}}(A,\\Gamma(X,\\mathcal O_X))\r\n    \\\\&amp;\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\operatorname{Spec}\\Gamma(X,\\mathcal O_X),\\operatorname{Spec}A).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的仿射化又称</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">仿射闭包</span></strong> (affine closure).</p>\n<h3>Serre <span lang=\"zh\">判别法</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为拟紧</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟分离概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟分离</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为仿射概形当且仅当</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体截面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>\n$$\r\n\\Gamma (X,-) \\colon \\mathsf{QCoh}(X) \\to \\mathsf{Ab}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">正合</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶仿射性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶仿射性</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}